{"id": "q0362", "pool": "easy-fact", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, mus lin is a type of fabric that's really lightweight and thin. It' s often used for things like curtains or clothing because it breathe s well. Then chen il is another kind of fabric that's usually a bit thicker and softer than muslin. It has a smooth texture and is great for making suit s or other high-qu ality clothes. Both are used in fashion but serve different purposes depending on the look and feel you want.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
