{"id": "q0441", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The St. Louis Cardinal s are a Major League Baseball team that plays in the National League Central Division. They' re based in St. Louis, Missouri, and their home games are held at Busch Stadium. The team has a long history dating back to 18 82 when they were originally called the St. Louis Brown s.They later became the Car dinals in 1900. Over the years, they have won several World Series championship s, including some during the mid-2 0th century under manager Red Scho enfield. More recently, they've had successful season s with players like Albert Pujols, who played for them for many years.Their colors are red, white, and navy blue, and they' re known for their passionate fan base in the Midwest.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0446", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Recycling is important because it helps reduce waste, saves resources, and cut s down on pollution. When we recycle materials like paper, plastic, glass, and metal, we use less energy to make new products compared to making them from raw materials. This not only help s conserve natural resources but also reduce s the amount of trash that ends up in land fills or polluting our environment. Plus, recycling creates jobs and supports a more sustainable future for everyone.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0453", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So, we know that sugar is a reward. We like sweet treats because they're tasty and delicious. But there's actually more to it than just the taste. It turns out that sugar also stimulate s the release of dopamine in our brain, which makes us feel good when we eat it. This can lead to cravings for more sugary foods and can even contribute to conditions like diabetes if consumed in excess.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0458", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Dr. Javago was written by Boris Pa ulevsky. It' s a famous novel set in the Soviet Union during the 1 9 20s and 30s, exploring political conflict and personal relationships.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0470", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most crowded surf spot s in the world tend to be located in popular destinations with excellent waves and a strong surfing culture. Some of the most well-known and crowd ed spots include Sur fer's Point in San Onof re, California, USA, which is famous for its consistent waves but can get very busy, especially on weekends or during peak seasons. Another highly frequented spot is Bondi Beach in Sydney, Australia, where the iconic waves attract both locals and tourists alike, leading to large crowds at times.In Hawaii, places like Pipeline on Oahu's North Shore become packed during major swell s, particularly during events such as the Bill abong Pro. In Costa Rica, Tamar indo's beaches are known for their great surf and draw many surf ers, making it quite crowd ed, especially during holiday periods. Other notable spots include Uluwatu in Bali, Indonesia, which has some of the best waves in the region, and Praia Do Urub u in Brazil, which sees heavy surfer traffic due to its consistent waves and vibrant surf scene. These locations often have high demand, so visiting early in the morning or during off-peak times", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
